  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Modernize target frameworks:\n- Change net461 to net462\n- Add net8.0, net9.0 & net10.0\n\nModernize API & implementation:\n- Add overloads matching System.Linq.AsyncEnumerable API (i.e. async lambdas should have a `CancellationToken` parameter)\n- Remove ConfigureAwait(false) calls, matching System.Linq.AsyncEnumerable.\n\nBreaking Changes:\n- PartitionAsync now returns a `ValueTask<(IEnumerable<TSource> True, IEnumerable<TSource> False)>` instead of a `ValueTask<(IAsyncEnumerable<TSource> True, IAsyncEnumerable<TSource> False)>`\n- Hide CountBy, DistinctBy, Index, SkipLast, TakeLast & ToDictionary since they're included in .NET",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
